Ans8:A website can be either static or dynamic, depending on how its content is displayed and updated.

Static Website

A static website has fixed content. The information remains the same for every user and changes only when the developer updates the code.

Example: Portfolio website, College information website.

Dynamic Website

A dynamic website shows different content based on the user or database. Its content can change automatically.

Example: Amazon, Facebook, Instagram.

